+    "server_witness_note": "Read from /proc/<pid>/exe + nvidia-smi per-PID gpu_bus_id. This is the authoritative check, and it is NOT redundant with the per-cell guard: cells REUSE a persistent server, and on reuse the proposer's _proc handle is None, so the per-cell 'is it the build-hip binary?' assertion cannot fire. This witness covers that case.",
